@startuml
' 设计类图：分层架构中各层的类、接口及其依赖关系
' 对应《实验指导书》实验一·步骤4 "设计各层包含的类、接口及其交互（类图）"

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "presentation 展现层 (routers)" {
  class ReadersRouter <<APIRouter>>
  class CatalogRouter <<APIRouter>>
  class CirculationRouter <<APIRouter>>
  class ReservationRouter <<APIRouter>>
  class AdminRouter <<APIRouter>>
}

package "application 应用层 (services)" {
  class ReaderService
  class CatalogService
  class CirculationService
  class ReservationService
  class AdminService
  class BorrowPolicyService <<Strategy>>
  class FineService <<Strategy>>
}

package "infrastructure 基础设施层 (repositories)" {
  class ReaderRepo <<Repository>>
  class BorrowCardRepo <<Repository>>
  class BookTitleRepo <<Repository>>
  class LibraryItemRepo <<Repository>>
  class LoanRepo <<Repository>>
  class FineRecordRepo <<Repository>>
  class ReservationRepo <<Repository>>
}

package "domain 领域层 (entities)" {
  class Reader
  class BorrowCard
  class BookTitle
  class LibraryItem
  class Loan
  class Reservation
  class BorrowPolicy
  class FineRule
  class FineRecord
  class Librarian
  class SystemAdmin
}

package "dto 传输对象 (schemas)" {
  class ReaderCreate
  class BorrowRequest
  class ReturnRequest
  class ReservationRequest
}

' 展现层 -> 应用层
ReadersRouter ..> ReaderService
ReadersRouter ..> CirculationService
ReadersRouter ..> ReservationService
CatalogRouter ..> CatalogService
CirculationRouter ..> CirculationService
ReservationRouter ..> ReservationService
AdminRouter ..> ReaderService
AdminRouter ..> CatalogService
AdminRouter ..> BorrowPolicyService
AdminRouter ..> FineService
AdminRouter ..> AdminService

' 应用层 -> 基础设施层（Repository 接口）
ReaderService ..> ReaderRepo
ReaderService ..> BorrowCardRepo
CatalogService ..> BookTitleRepo
CatalogService ..> LibraryItemRepo
CirculationService ..> BorrowCardRepo
CirculationService ..> LibraryItemRepo
CirculationService ..> LoanRepo
CirculationService ..> FineRecordRepo
ReservationService ..> ReaderRepo
ReservationService ..> BookTitleRepo
ReservationService ..> ReservationRepo
AdminService ..> ReaderRepo
AdminService ..> BorrowCardRepo
AdminService ..> BookTitleRepo
AdminService ..> LibraryItemRepo

' 应用层内部：CirculationService 组合两个策略服务
CirculationService ..> BorrowPolicyService : <<use>>
CirculationService ..> FineService : <<use>>

' 基础设施层 -> 领域层
ReaderRepo ..> Reader
BorrowCardRepo ..> BorrowCard
BookTitleRepo ..> BookTitle
LibraryItemRepo ..> LibraryItem
LoanRepo ..> Loan
FineRecordRepo ..> FineRecord
ReservationRepo ..> Reservation
BorrowPolicyService ..> BorrowPolicy
FineService ..> FineRule

' 展现层 -> 传输对象
ReadersRouter ..> ReaderCreate
CirculationRouter ..> BorrowRequest
CirculationRouter ..> ReturnRequest
ReservationRouter ..> ReservationRequest

note bottom of CirculationService
  编排借阅/归还流程：
  borrow() 依次调用 BorrowPolicyService
  与 FineService 完成策略校验，
  经 Repository 持久化，体现
  服务层 + 策略 + 仓库 模式。
end note

@enduml
